  "stylePrompt": "Reproduce the attached game's character sprite sheet as a NEW CLEAN TOON ILLUSTRATION WITH SPARSE PIXEL TEXTURE, optimized to read at 48-80 pixels on a tactical battle board.\nFollow the reference's exact character identity, costume, hair color and silhouette, halo, weapon, accessories, proportions and six view directions. Do not invent outfits or remove signature equipment.\nSTYLE: smooth confident dark contours and anti-aliased edges; large simple cel-shaded color shapes; two or three clear light/shadow values per material; bold readable facial features; clearly separated hair, hands, clothing and weapon. Preserve a retro game feel ONLY through a few intentional square accent marks within shadow/highlight regions, no all-over pixel grid, jagged contours, dithering, blurry texture or micro-detail. This must look noticeably cleaner and smoother than the low-resolution reference, not an upscaled or filtered copy. Keep the chibi full-body proportions and original age-appropriate fully clothed uniform.\nOUTPUT: one transparent RGBA landscape sprite atlas, exactly 3 equal columns by 2 equal rows, ideally 1536 by 1024 pixels with six 512-square cells. EXACTLY ONE complete full-body character per cell, separated by generous transparent gutters, no clipping, feet aligned to a common baseline within each cell, halos included. Columns and rows match the reference: top row front-left / front / front-right; bottom row back-left / back / back-right. All six poses must have the same scale and consistent designs. No text, labels, separators, border, checkerboard, ground plane, scenery or cast shadow. Genuine transparent background.",
  "identities": {
    "aris": "Aris (아리스): very long dark navy hair, blue eyes, cyan geometric halo, white and navy uniform, enormous white-and-blue railgun.",
    "aru": "Aru (아루): long rose-red hair, gold-and-black curved horns, red circular halo, burgundy black-and-gold coat and skirt, red eyes, long dark rifle.",
    "azusa": "Azusa (아즈사): long lavender-white hair, violet eyes, gold halo and purple flower hair ornament, black-and-white uniform with gold tie, small white wings, long rifle.",
    "haruna": "Haruna (하루나): long silver hair, red eyes, black beret with orange emblem, thin orange halo, black military coat with orange and gold trim, long rifle and dark tail.",
    "hifumi": "Hifumi (히후미): light brown twin tails with yellow ribbons, gold halo, white school uniform with yellow bow, plaid skirt, pink shoes, pink-and-white rifle and backpack.",
    "hina": "Hina (히나): very long pale lilac hair, purple eyes, dark horns, intricate purple horizontal halo, dark military coat with red armband, gold accents, small dark purple bat wings, large machine gun.",
    "hoshino": "Hoshino (호시노): very long pastel pink hair and cowlick, sleepy eyes, pale pink halo, white shirt and dark tactical vest, turquoise tie, dark skirt, white-and-navy shoes, compact shotgun.",
    "iori": "Iori (이오리): long silver-lavender twin-tail hair, dark horns, purple ring halo, reddish eyes, dark military uniform, red armband, tall dark boots, long brown-and-black rifle.",
    "izuna": "Izuna (이즈나): short dark brown hair, fox ears and fluffy cream fox tail, pink ring halo, gold eyes, bright pink floral ninja outfit with dark skirt, red ribbon and firearm.",
    "koharu": "Koharu (코하루): pastel pink twin braids, black beret, dark feather accessories, pink halo, dark school uniform with pink trim and pink bow, striped socks, long pink-and-dark rifle carried horizontally.",
    "maki": "Maki (마키): vivid red hair in two big top buns, blue eyes, red geometric halo, black jacket with white sleeves and red accents, dark pleated skirt, striped socks, large blue-patterned machine gun with yellow details.",
    "midori": "Midori (미도리): short peach-blonde hair, bright green eyes, cat-ear gaming headset, lime green halo, green hoodie under black jacket, dark shorts, white socks, neon green-and-black sniper rifle.",
    "mika": "Mika (미카): very long pink hair, violet-and-gold halo, lavender eyes, small white feather wings, white-and-lavender uniform dress with gold ornaments, dark stockings and white boots, white-and-lavender firearm.",
    "natsu": "Natsu (나츠): long light pink twin-tail hair, sleepy pink eyes, pale pink halo, white-and-light-blue sailor uniform with red bow, black leggings, dark shoes, compact blue-and-white firearm.",
    "neru": "Neru (네루): short orange hair, orange halo, sharp orange eyes, black jacket with gold dragon details over black-and-white maid uniform, red socks, paired black-and-orange compact guns.",
    "noa": "Noa (ノア / 노아): extremely long pale blue-white hair, violet eyes, cyan ring halo, blue hair accessory, white-and-blue coat with black bow, dark skirt and stockings, small black pistol.",
    "shiroko": "Shiroko (시로코): silver-gray bob haircut, wolf ears, blue eyes, turquoise halo, dark school uniform with bright cyan scarf, white socks, blue-and-lime shoes, black-and-cyan rifle.",
    "wakamo": "Wakamo (와카모): long dark hair, fox ears and fox tail, signature red-and-white fox mask, red circular halo, black-and-crimson floral kimono, long horizontal rifle. Keep the fox mask exactly as the reference.",
    "yuuka": "Yuuka (유우카): long dark purple hair in two low bunches, purple eyes, dark blue elliptical halo, white-and-navy uniform jacket with cyan accents, dark skirt, two compact navy-and-cyan pistols.",
    "yuzu": "Yuzu (유즈): long red side ponytail, shy sleepy expression, orange geometric halo, white jacket with teal sleeves and yellow accents, dark shorts and orange shoes, black-and-orange grenade launcher."
